  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_0677.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Mucha animaci&oacute;n en Chaplin Caf&eacute; y Druida Bar&amp;Drinks, en las cenas de Man&aacute; Bar, Gran Hotel Toledo y La Toska, menos en la Puerta del Sol, nuevamente animado en New Robinson y Colonial, as&iacute; como en el pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda con la orquesta Marengo, organizada por el Consell de Festes y gestionada por Ocultas Producciones.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0383.jpg\" alt=\"img_0383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0384.jpg\" alt=\"img_0384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0386.jpg\" alt=\"img_0386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0387.jpg\" alt=\"img_0387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0388.jpg\" alt=\"img_0388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0390.jpg\" alt=\"img_0390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0391.jpg\" alt=\"img_0391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitdecapdany2017/img_0392.jpg\" alt=\"img_0392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nit